.git
# **A developer machine's settings stay on it** (§1002). `apps/web/.env.local`
# is committed for `next dev` and sets NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_MODE=dev, and `next
# build` reads it - so every web image built from this context drew the
# "Paste an access token" sign-in that `src/lib/auth.ts` says must never be
# deployed. (A pasted token was still verified by the API; the box was there.)
**/.env*.local
